{
  "server": "jp",
  "storyId": "main_2_level_main_02-09_end",
  "groupId": "main_2",
  "stageId": "main_02-09",
  "title": "裏工作",
  "storyCode": "2-9",
  "avgTag": "戦闘後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b6a30c1894a021f0c40ddbea525b561500fa7597d0935e77ebbb02964e8a624f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十一关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "これで……最後！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "がはっ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "敵追撃部隊、制圧完了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "周囲に敵影なし！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "ところで、指揮を執ってた幹部は？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "この部隊にはいなかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "となると、どこかに潜伏して様子見しつつ、あとをつけてきてるってとこかしら。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "大方、あたしたちの体力切れを待って、確実に仕留められるタイミングで襲撃するつもりでしょうね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "はい。恐らく、そうだと思います。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "チェルノボーグでの経験からして、レユニオンは奇襲作戦を得意としているようですし。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ここはひとまず、撤退しましょう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "ですが、現状の撤退ルートでは、安全とは言い切れません。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "交差点を塞ぐ形でビルを破壊されでもしたら、危険に晒されることは明白ですから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "では、すぐにほかのルートを探しましょう。できるだけ目立たない道が理想です！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "アーミヤさん、四時方向のはしごから降りるのはどうでしょう？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "んー、ちょっと無理があると思うけど？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "はああっ！　ロドスめ、覚悟しろ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "！　伏兵です、気をつけて！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "行け、続けて追撃しろ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "息つく暇を与えるな！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "……あの、隊長さん。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "――スラムの中には……子供の感染者もいるんです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "できることなら、どうか……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "あの子たちを、守ってあげてくれませんか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "……龍門の治安を守ることは、もとより近衛局の責務だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "感染者は、龍門の市民ではないが――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "――紛れもなく、龍門の一部ではある。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "ゆえに、私は私の為すべきことを為そう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "キミの頼みには、何を保障することもできんがな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "結局のところ――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "――でも、あの子たちから聞いたんです。前にも、あなたが……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "="
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "――我々は常に、そうした責務に努めてきたし、今後もそう在り続ける。それだけの話だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "……ありがとう、ございます。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "ときに、我々がキミを探していた理由については理解しているか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "いえ……はっきりとはわかりません。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "私には、あなたたちに必要とされるような心当たりはないですし……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "だけど、もしかしたら……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "その理由は、私自身じゃなくて――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "――お父さんにあるんじゃないか、って。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "……その通りだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "キミのお父上は、チェルノボーグの高名な科学者だったと聞いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "それと同時に、かの都市における政治的な重要人物の一人だった、ともな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "ゆえに、キミは何かを知りえている可能性がある。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "――とはいえ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "あくまで可能性の話だが。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "とにかく、キミがレユニオンの手に落ちるような事態は避けねばならない、というのが我々の見解だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "アハッ、み～つけた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "ごめんなさいねぇ？　近衛局に恨みはないんだけど――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "今回はと～っても面白い筋書きを用意しちゃったの。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "これをもっと素敵な喜劇にするために……あんたたちにも、舞台へ上がってもらわないとね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "char_1504_cqbw#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "portraitKey": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "それじゃあ……早速、始めましょうか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
